SUMMARY:Gevity — copy-edit pass applied + deployed to gevity.fit
DESCRIPTION:Applied yesterday's copy-edit drafts (*-NEW.html) onto the live pages and shipped to production.\n\nDeliverables:\n- science.html: added the Kokkinos 2022 (JACC\, 750k veterans) citation\, the combined ~40% mortality stat tile\, DOI "View study" links on all 5 references\, a "Last reviewed July 2026" line\, and renumbered footnotes (all anchors verified\, none dangling).\n- index.html: reframed the science blurb (added the ~40% combined-mortality figure)\, reworded the chart caption toward consistency\, and commented out the unverifiable "Sarah M." testimonial (FTC endorsement risk).\n- how-it-works.html: softened the testimonial ("tracked my 23rd consecutive workout" -> "logged my 23rd workout")\; cardio grid left intact.\n- for-coaches.html: added a private-beta disclaimer\; "10 workouts in a row" -> "10th workout logged".\n- Verified all four pages in-browser (no console errors)\; deleted the four redundant *-NEW.html drafts.\n- Commit eba3eb3 on main\; pushed origin/main (cad52fa..eba3eb3) — ships both of today's commits (cardio grid + copy edits) to the gevity.fit deploy.\n\nRaw window (America/New_York): ~16:38 start (diff review of yesterday's drafts) to ~17:01 (push complete + confirmation). Rounded to 16:45–17:15.
END:VEVENT
